 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":211865,"global_rank":274162,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46010},{"name":"mattcwilde/vetrr","owner":"mattcwilde","html_url":"https://github.com/mattcwilde/vetrr","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"GUI to vet the cgm-squared redrock galaxy redshifts","topics":[],"score":211861,"global_rank":307685,"on_pypi":true,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46011},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://github.com/dlauritzen/SqlRest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A super-thin MySQL REST API","topics":[],"score":211859,"global_rank":274172,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46012},{"name":"anican/style_transfer","owner":"anican","html_url":"https://github.com/anican/style_transfer","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Implementation of style_transfer method https://arxiv.org/pdf/1508.06576.pdf","topics":[],"score":211858,"global_rank":274185,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46013},{"name":"amanpreet692/kg_amanpreet692_2021","owner":"amanpreet692","html_url":"https://github.com/amanpreet692/kg_amanpreet692_2021","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Repo for Kargo Hiring Challenge Code","topics":[],"score":211858,"global_rank":274188,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46014},{"name":"Rasenku/PortScanner","owner":"Rasenku","html_url":"https://github.com/Rasenku/PortScanner","s